+    "why": "router.use('/invoices/:id', requireOwner) compiles to the fully anchored regex ^/invoices/([^/]+)$ (src/router.js:13), so the ownership middleware never runs for /invoices/:id/pdf. getInvoicePdf (src/invoices.js:25-28) checks only existence, not ownership, and returns Bob's invoice inv_1002 to Alice as base64 PDF content: 'Invoice inv_1002 / Customer cust_bob / Consulting: 990.00 / Total 990.00'. Fix: check invoice.customer === req.user.id in getInvoicePdf (or have the middleware match by prefix)."
+  },
